#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:3
#: a41a74e1a4544104a083fd53c3a78973
msgid ""
"Whole-body MPC (**全身控制**) for wheeled dual-arm robots, using "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`."
msgstr "轮式双臂的全身 MPC（**全身控制**），使用 `ocs2_wheel_humanoid`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:5
#: 38f5e00ba0974272886c1b635a8e935e
msgid "Access Required"
msgstr "需要访问权限"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:8
#: c8a1988fafcf4fee946323ea9a7ea770
msgid ""
"`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller` in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) is"
" a **private** submodule (`ocs2-wbc-controller`). Topics, FSM values, and"
" launch names are in that package README after access. The in-tree loader"
" on the public side is `full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) 中的"
" `controller/ocs2_wbc_controller` 是**私有**子模块（`ocs2-wbc-"
"controller`）。话题、FSM 取值和 launch 名在开通后的包 README 里。公开侧的仓内加载器是 "
"`full_body.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:11
#: 5384e34d006b4115a961b96ac403adde
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:13
#: 89f31e78e21d4363aef201fa6d633101
msgid ""
"Unified **全身控制** stack: one `ocs2_wbc_controller` instead of arm MPC plus"
" separate body/head joint controllers"
msgstr "统一的**全身控制**栈：一个 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，而不是手臂 MPC 加独立的身体/头关节控制器"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:14
#: bb3f7496a78546c3b0cf7726c5b1b0bf
msgid ""
"Motion library: `ocs2_wheel_humanoid` (see "
"[ocs2-humanoid](4-ocs2_humanoid.md))"
msgstr "[ocs2-humanoid](4-ocs2_humanoid.md)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:16
#: 6f5cf350f40a4087b94f40d157ae9bf5
msgid ""
"Contrast with **分体控制 (split)**: "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + "
"[basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md) via "
"`split_body.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"对比**分体控制 (split)**：[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + "
"[basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)，由 "
"`split_body.launch.py` 启动。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:18
#: d8ccd51d14a64a689b17c7f2e9009871
msgid "Launch (from `ocs2_arm_controller`)"
msgstr "启动（来自 `ocs2_arm_controller`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:20
#: 0d7874961c1d4083b5f94dc09ca3acea
msgid ""
"There is no public README listing a `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` "
"entry point. The in-tree path that loads this controller is:"
msgstr "公开 README 没有列出 `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口。仓库内加载该控制器的路径是："

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:22
#: b0b3e37d5ca54c90b33b99900c314875
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:26
#: 756cb4d9e28c4e4996e363353976b612
msgid ""
"`full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` `full_body`) spawns "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` when the robot’s `controller_manager` type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`."
msgstr ""
"当机器人 `controller_manager` 的 type 为 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` "
"时，`full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` 为 `full_body`）会拉起 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:28
#: 674927e30a7b4f20a63446831c2a36b6
msgid ""
"The same file declares `type` and "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` (`left_type` / `right_type`, "
"`use_profile_eef`). End-effectors: "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) and "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"同一文件声明 `type` 和 `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`（`left_type` / "
"`right_type`、`use_profile_eef`）。末端见 "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) 与 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:30
#: 676fb91837a449748a3d90e4cdb21753
msgid ""
"`split_body.launch.py` is the split (分体) path; whole-body control uses "
"`full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr "`split_body.launch.py` 是分体路径；全身控制用 `full_body.launch.py`。"

